 130:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *
 131:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  This function is used to write to the value field of the specified attribute
 132:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  in the GATT database of a GATT Server. If attribute is CCCD, the value is
 133:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  stored in specific CCCD storages.
 134:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  This is a blocking function. No event is generated on calling this function.
 135:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *
 136:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  If a peer device connected to the GATT Server initiates a write operation,
 137:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  this function is executed on the GATT Server. During such a call, the function
 138:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  checks for the attribute permissions (flags) before executing the write
 139:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  operation by calling.
 140:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *
 141:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  \param param: Parameter is of type \ref cy_stc_ble_gatts_db_attr_val_info_t.
 142:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *
 143:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** * \return
 144:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  \ref cy_en_ble_gatt_err_code_t : Return value indicates if the function succeeded or
 145:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  failed. The following are possible error codes:
 146:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *
 147:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  Errors codes                                | Description
 148:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  ------------                                | -----------
 149:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  CY_BLE_GATT_ERR_NONE                        | On successful operation.
 150:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  CY_BLE_GATT_ERR_INVALID_HANDLE              | 'handleValuePair.attrHandle' is not valid.
 151:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  CY_BLE_GATT_ERR_WRITE_NOT_PERMITTED         | write operation is not permitted on this attribute
 152:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  CY_BLE_GATT_ERR_UNLIKELY_ERROR              | Invalid arguments passed.
