 357:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *
 358:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  This function is used to write to the value field of the specified attribute
 359:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  in the GATT database of a GATT Server by a peer device.
 360:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  If the attribute is CCCD, the value is stored in specific CCCD storages. Writing
 361:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  a CCCD value must be executed in the connected state.
 362:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  This is a blocking function. No event is generated on calling this function.
 363:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *
 364:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  If a peer device connected to the GATT Server initiates a Write operation,
 365:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  this function is executed on the GATT Server. During such a call, the function
 366:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  checks for the attribute permissions (flags) before executing the Write
 367:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble_gatt.c **** *  operation by calling.
